--- Slide 7 ---
Leadership Skills for Students
Conflict Handling & Ethical Leadership
Stay Calm & Listen
Hear both sides before making judgments.
Be Fair to Everyone
Treat all team members equally without favoritism.
Find Win-Win Solutions
Help resolve disagreements so everyone benefits.
Lead by Example
Show honesty and integrity in your actions.
