Leadership Skills for Students
Real-Life Leadership Examples
Class Monitor: Maintains discipline and represents the class
Sports Captain: Motivates team and leads during matches Group Project Leader: Organizes tasks and ensures teamwork Club Leader: Plans events and encourages participation Everyday Leader: Helping classmates and taking initiative
